GET http://localhost:8080/professional

### Get all contacts
GET http://localhost:8080/contacts

### Get one contact by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/contacts/6aad0723bc37c60302582993

### Create a new contact
POST http://localhost:8080/contacts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "David",
  "lastName": "Brown",
  "email": "davidbrown@gmail.com",
  "favoriteColor": "Red",
  "birthday": "1999-03-25"
}

### Update a contact
PUT http://localhost:8080/contacts/6ab1bd9bd9c9f6180e1493b2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "David",
  "lastName": "Brown",
  "email": "davidbrown@gmail.com",
  "favoriteColor": "Orange",
  "birthday": "1999-03-25"
}

### Get updated contact
GET http://localhost:8080/contacts/6ab1bd9bd9c9f6180e1493b2


### Delete contact
DELETE http://localhost:8080/contacts/6ab1bd9bd9c9f6180e1493b2

### Verify deleted contact
GET http://localhost:8080/contacts/6ab1bd9bd9c9f6180e1493b2

### GET contact with invalid ID
GET http://localhost:8080/contacts/hello